Ensemble tuner inputs
=====================

The launchers select input_misc/tuner/error_combined_001.in as their legacy
control file. run_scripts/run_tuner.py -prepare_only combines those controls
with the current JSON model inputs immediately before the native launch.
Optimized tunable_parameters_*.json files are fed directly
to run_scm.py and archived with each member. mytuner_movingfoot.bash changes
its JSON starting-parameter selection when a member improves the cost.

These are historical, site-specific launchers. Set their checkout/archive
paths and provide the benchmark data before using them. mytuner_messner.bash
requires current CLUBB checkouts on the remote nodes. Their historical control files
retain old experiment choices; the old experiment requires a separate physics and
benchmark compatibility review before a full run.

Doing a basic `at' job:
    
1.) at -f ./atjob.bash now

(Come back in a number of hours/days)

2.) Go to your ARCHIVE/CASE directory.  Run sortresults.bash for sorted results.
 
